{
  "comment": "ATX heading scan shared by yohu-ai::extract_outline_items and UI extractMarkdownToc. Leading h1 is skipped from the outline; ids still count it. Fenced ``` toggles ignore. A line starting with $$ is skipped (not a math fence). Only #–####.",
